OL,3,GNEWSAStories to make you smile from
OL,4,Aacross Yorkshire
OL,5,
OL,6,FEvery week in Yorkshire we cover
OL,7,Fuplifting and feel-good stories about
OL,8,Fpeople, places and animals across our
OL,9,Fregion - and we like to shout about
OL,10,Fthem.
OL,12,FThis week, we focus on two youngsters
OL,13,Fwho have overcome health obstacles to
OL,14,Fstart primary school with their peers,
OL,15,Ftwo "starving" cats who have found a
OL,16,Floving new home, and the mystery of how
OL,17,Fa stone monolith came to be in a
OL,18,FYorkshire field.
